BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: TorontoBabel Language Exchange
UID:event_316430781@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261107T055720Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261111T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261111T230000
SUMMARY:Language Exchange & Social Event @ Madison Ave Pub by Toronto Babe
 l
DESCRIPTION:TorontoBabel: Toronto's International Language Exchange\n🌎*
 *Toronto Babel – Language Exchange & Social Night!** 🎉\n\nLooking to 
 meet new people\, discover different cultures\, and switch up your usual W
 ednesday night?\n\nCome hang out with Toronto Babel for an evening of lang
 uages\, music\, games\, and good company! Whether you’re here to practic
 e English\, share your native language\, or simply expand your social circ
 le\, there’s always someone new to meet and something to talk about. 
 🫶✨\n\n✨ **What’s Happening:**\n\n💬 **Language Exchange** – P
 ractice English and connect through French\, Spanish\, Korean\, Japanese\,
  Mandarin\, and more!\n\n🎲 **Board Games** – Break the ice and challe
 nge someone new\n\n🎨 **Arts & Crafts** – Get creative and try somethi
 ng different\n\n🎧 **Resident DJ** – Enjoy the music while you mingle\
 n\n🌍 **Meet New People** – Connect with friendly faces from around th
 e world\n\n📍 **Madison Avenue Pub**\n14 Madison Ave\, Toronto\, ON M5R 
 2S1\n🕖 **7:00 PM – 11:00 PM**\n\nWhether you’re rolling in solo or 
 bringing your crew\, come ready to meet new people\, share a few laughs\, 
 and make some unexpected connections. Pull up solo or bring a friend—eit
 her way\, you’ll leave with new connections\, good laughs\, and even bet
 ter vibes 💬🫶🌟\n\n💵 **$5 Entry Donation at the Door**\nYour con
 tribution helps cover Meetup fees and event essentials like name tags\, ga
 mes\, stickers\, and other supplies that keep our community going. Thank y
 ou for supporting Toronto Babel! ❤️\n\n📩 **CONTACT:** Terry (Organi
 zer)\n💸 **E-transfer:** [tmg8@wealthsimple.me](mailto:tmg8@wealthsimple
 .me)\n\n🔗 **Stay Connected & Join Us:**\n\n📸 Instagram: [https://www
 .instagram.com/t.o.babel](https://www.instagram.com/t.o.babel)\n\n📅 Mee
 tup: [https://www.meetup.com/TorontoBabel](https://www.meetup.com/TorontoB
 abel)\n\n💬 WhatsApp Group Chat: [https://chat.whatsapp.com/EYMdUw8XaxE5
 irFSNg5bt7](https://chat.whatsapp.com/EYMdUw8XaxE5irFSNg5bt7)\n\n📘 Face
 book: [https://www.facebook.com/groups/torontobabel](https://www.facebook.
 com/groups/torontobabel)\n\n👉 **See what’s coming up and RSVP on our 
 calendar:**\n[https://www.meetup.com/TorontoBabel/#calendar](https://www.m
 eetup.com/TorontoBabel/#calendar)\n\n🛡️ **Community Guidelines:**\nTo
 ronto Babel is a welcoming\, inclusive\, and safe space for everyone. Our 
 events focus on language exchange\, cultural sharing\, and friendship — 
 **not for dating or matchmaking.** Harassment and inappropriate behavior w
 ill not be tolerated. If you experience or witness anything concerning\, p
 lease let an organizer know so we can help.\n\nCome for the conversations\
 , stay for the community! 🌎💬❤️\n\n#TorontoBabel #LanguageExchang
 e #TorontoEvents #ToDoToronto #LearnEnglish #MeetNewPeople #TorontoSocial 
 #CulturalExchange #MakeFriendsInToronto
