 ng different\n\n🎧 **Resident DJ** – Enjoy the music while you mingle\
 n\n🌍 **Meet New People** – Connect with friendly faces from around th
 e world\n\n📍 **Madison Avenue Pub**\n14 Madison Ave\, Toronto\, ON M5R 
 2S1\n🕖 **7:00 PM – 11:00 PM**\n\nWhether you’re rolling in solo or 
